        <p><seg source="#source-16691-16718">やまとの　たかさじ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-16718-16730"><rb>野</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-16730-16742">を、なゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-16742-16754"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-16754-16799">く　をとめども。たれをしまかむ</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-16799-16940"><seg source="#source-16832-16835">（</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-16835-16883"><seg source="#source-16835-16847">おほくめ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-16883-16886">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-16886-16904"><rb>命</rb><rt>みこと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-16904-16907">）</seg></hi></p>
