07">れるために、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28007-28028"><rb>幾重</rb><rt>いくへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28028-28034">もの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28034-28049"><rb>垣</rb><rt>かき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28049-28052">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28052-28067"><rb>作</rb><rt>つく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28067-28088">つてゐる、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28088-28109"><rb>幾重</rb><rt>いくへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28109-28115">もの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28115-28130"><rb>垣</rb><rt>かき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28130-28151">よ。これがわれ</seg><choice source="#source-28151-28157"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-28157-28160">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28160-28184"><rb>結婚</rb><rt>けつこん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28184-28187">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28187-28202"><rb>祝</rb><rt>いは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28202-28205">ふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28205-28226"><rb>自然</rb><rt>しぜん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28226-28252">のしるしである。</seg></p>
