        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28741-28771"><rb>出雲人</rb><rt>いづもびと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28771-28774">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28774-28789"><rb>作</rb><rt>つく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28789-28798">つた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28798-28819"><rb>幾重</rb><rt>いくへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28819-28825">にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28825-28837"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28837-28840">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28840-28855"><rb>廻</rb><rt>まは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28855-28861">す、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28861-28885"><rb>屏風</rb><rt>びようぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28885-28888">・</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28888-28906"><rb>張</rb><rt>とばり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28906-28909">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28909-28924"><rb>類</rb><rt>るい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28924-28936">よ。われ</seg><choice source="#source-28936-28942"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-28942-28945">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28945-28963"><rb>新</rb><rt>あたら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28963-28969">しく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28969-28993"><rb>結婚</rb><rt>けつこん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28993-29008">したものを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29008-29023"><rb>包</rb><rt>つゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29023-29038">むために、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29038-29059"><rb>幾重</rb><rt>いくへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29059-29062">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29062-29077"><rb>圍</rb><rt>かこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29077-29083">ひを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29083-29098"><rb>作</rb><rt>つく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29098-29137">つてあることよ。あゝ、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29137-29158"><rb>幾重</rb><rt>いくへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29158-29161">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29161-29185"><rb>屏風</rb><rt>びようぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29185-29188">・</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29188-29206"><rb>張</rb><rt>とばり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29206-29214">よ。</seg></p>
