        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-37820-37829">この</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37829-37844"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37844-37847">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37847-37862"><rb>別</rb><rt>べつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37862-37874">ですが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37874-37889"><rb>多</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37889-37940">くさうしたふうにどこからともなく、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37940-37955"><rb>風</rb><rt>かぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37955-37958">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37958-37970"><rb>吹</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37970-37973">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37973-37988"><rb>起</rb><rt>おこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37988-38012">るようにはやつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38012-38024"><rb>來</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38024-38027">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38027-38042"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38042-38048">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38048-38072"><rb>不思議</rb><rt>ふしぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38072-38075">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38075-38093"><rb>氣持</rb><rt>きも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38093-38108">ちで、びく</seg><choice source="#source-38108-38114"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-38114-38129">しながら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38129-38144"><rb>耳</rb><rt>みゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38144-38147">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38147-38159"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38159-38165">てゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38165-38177"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38177-38222">いてゐました。さうしてさういふ</seg><