        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53875-53896"><rb>今度</rb><rt>こんど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53896-53902">のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53902-53920"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53920-53929">では、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53929-53950"><rb>短歌</rb><rt>たんか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53950-53953">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53953-53968"><rb>竝</rb><rt>なら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53968-53971">べ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53971-53989"><rb>稱</rb><rt>しよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53989-54007">せられてゐる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54007-54031"><rb>長歌</rb><rt>ちようか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54031-54046">のことは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54046-54061"><rb>省</rb><rt>はぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54061-54106">きたいとおもひます。がこれは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54106-54130"><rb>大體</rb><rt>だいたい</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54130-54166"><rb>第一章</rb><rt>だいいつしよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54166-54181">のところで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54181-54193"><rb>述</rb><rt>の</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54193-54205">べてある</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54205-54232"><rb>物語</rb><rt>ものがたり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54232-54235">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54235-54250"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54250-54259">から、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54259-54280"><rb>變化</rb><rt>へんか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54280-54286">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54286-54298"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54298-54310">たものと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54