"#source-63961-63979"><rb>心</rb><rt>こゝろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63979-63982">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63982-63997"><rb>起</rb><rt>おこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63997-64009">させる、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64009-64036"><rb>加古川</rb><rt>かこかは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64036-64039">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64039-64054"><rb>口</rb><rt>くち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64054-64060">の、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64060-64078"><rb>加古</rb><rt>かこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64078-64081">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64081-64096"><rb>島</rb><rt>しま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64096-64099">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64099-64111"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64111-64132">えてゐるといふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64132-64150"><rb>意味</rb><rt>いみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64150-64161">です。</seg></p>
