      <div type="layout" source="#source-71449-71903" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71484-71514"><rb>吉野川</rb><rt>よしのがは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71514-71517">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71517-71532"><rb>傍</rb><rt>そば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71532-71541">にある</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71541-71565"><rb>象山</rb><rt>きさやま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71565-71568">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71568-71583"><rb>山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71583-71604">のま、すなはち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71604-71619"><rb>空</rb><rt>そら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71619-71622">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71622-71637"><rb>接</rb><rt>せつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71637-71661">してゐるところの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71661-71679"><rb>梢</rb><rt>こずゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71679-71682">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71682-71700"><rb>見上</rb><rt>みあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71700-71748">げると、そこには、ひどくたくさん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71748-71766"><rb>集</rb><rt>あつま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71766-71772">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71772-71784"><rb>鳴</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71784-71796">いてゐる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71796-71811"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71811-71814">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71814-71829"><rb>聲</rb><rt>こゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71829-71841">、それが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71841-71856"><rb>聞</rb><rt>きこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71856-71867">える。</seg></p>
