        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-76709-76829"><seg source="#source-76709-76718">一一、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76718-76742"><rb>文學</rb><rt>ぶんがく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76742-76763">のねらひどころ</seg></head>
