        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79261-79300"><rb>萬葉集</rb><rt>まんにようしゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79300-79315">には、まだ</seg><choice source="#source-79315-79321"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79321-79345"><rb>上手</rb><rt>じようず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79345-79348">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79348-79363"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79363-79402">が、たくさんにゐます。だが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79402-79426"><rb>日本</rb><rt>につぽん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79426-79429">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79429-79444"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79444-79447">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79447-79468"><rb>歴史</rb><rt>れきし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79468-79483">は、とても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79483-79501"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79501-79513">のために</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79513-79528"><rb>與</rb><rt>あた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79528-79540">へられた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79540-79561"><rb>紙數</rb><rt>しすう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79561-79567">では</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79567-79579"><rb>書</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79579-79582">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79582-79597"><rb>盡</rb><rt>つく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79597-79609">すことは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79609-79627"><rb>出來</rb><rt>でき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79627-79657">ないので、このへんで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79657-79669"><rb>切</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79669-79672">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79672-79684"><rb>上</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79684-79702">げて、つぎの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79702-79723"><rb>時代</rb><rt>じだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79723-79726">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79726-79741"><rb>移</rb><rt>うつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79741-79757">ります。</seg></p>
