      <div type="layout" source="#source-88744-89129" style="padding-inline-start: 2em; text-indent: -2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-88806-88818">（三）お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88818-88830"><rb>附</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88830-88836">きの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88836-88851"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88851-88860">よ。お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88860-88875"><rb>笠</rb><rt>かさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88875-88887">であると</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88887-88902"><rb>申</rb><rt>まを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88902-88905">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88905-88917"><rb>上</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88917-88932">げい。この</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88932-88959"><rb>宮城野</rb><rt>みやぎの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88959-88962">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88962-88974"><rb>木</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88974-88977">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88977-88992"><rb>上</rb><rt>うへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88992-89004">からふり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-89004-89016"><rb>落</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-89016-89022">ちる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-89022-89037"><rb>露</rb><rt>つゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-89037-89040">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-89040-89055"><rb>雨</rb><rt>あめ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-89055-89079"><rb>以上</rb><rt>いじよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-89079-89093">である。</seg></p>
