        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94501-94516"><rb>春</rb><rt>はる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94516-94519">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94519-94537"><rb>昔</rb><rt>むかし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94537-94540">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94540-94555"><rb>春</rb><rt>はる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94555-94573">ではないか。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94573-94588"><rb>月</rb><rt>つき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94588-94591">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94591-94609"><rb>昔</rb><rt>むかし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94609-94612">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94612-94627"><rb>月</rb><rt>つき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94627-94645">ではないか。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94645-94660"><rb>月</rb><rt>つき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94660-94663">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94663-94678"><rb>春</rb><rt>はる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94678-94684">も、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94684-94702"><rb>昔</rb><rt>むかし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94702-94732">のまゝのものである。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94732-94762"><rb>自然物</rb><rt>しぜんぶつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94762-94777">はさうして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94777-94792"><rb>變</rb><rt>かは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94792-94813">らないでゐるに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94813-94831"><rb>拘</rb><rt>かゝは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94831-94840">らず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94840-94861"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94861-94864">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94864-94876"><rb>身</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94876-94885">だけは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94885-94900"><rb>元</rb><rt>もと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94900-94941">のまゝにして、さうして……</seg></p>
