        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106939-106972"><rb>日本人</rb><rt>につぽんじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106972-106978">と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106978-107011"><rb>西洋人</rb><rt>せいようじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107011-107026">とのあひの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107026-107038"><rb>子</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107038-107044">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107044-107077"><rb>日本人</rb><rt>につぽんじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107077-107095">とやいはむ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-107095-107128"><rb>西洋人</rb><rt>せいようじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-107128-107145">とやいはむ</seg></p>
