y type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115207-115219"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115219-115228">てゐる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115228-115243"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115243-115251">で、</seg></p>
