        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115286-115304"><rb>樗</rb><rt>あふち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115304-115307">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115307-115319"><rb>咲</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115319-115331">いてゐる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115331-115346"><rb>家</rb><rt>いへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115346-115349">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115349-115373"><rb>外側</rb><rt>そとがは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115373-115376">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115376-115394"><rb>木立</rb><rt>こだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115394-115400">ちの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115400-115424"><rb>下蔭</rb><rt>したかげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115424-115436">に、ぽた</seg><choice source="#source-115436-115442"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-115442-115445">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115445-115460"><rb>露</rb><rt>つゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115460-115463">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115463-115475"><rb>落</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115475-115481">ちる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115481-115496"><rb>程</rb><rt>ほど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115496-115502">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115502-115517"><rb>風</rb><rt>かぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115517-115520">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115520-115532"><rb>吹</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115532-115559">きとほる。それは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115559-115583"><rb>幾日</rb><rt>いくにち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115583-115586">か</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115586-115598"><rb>降</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115598-115601">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115601-115616"><rb>續</rb><rt>つゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115616-115631">いてをつた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115631-115652"><rb>梅雨</rb><rt>ばいう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115652-115655">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115655-115670"><rb>上</rb><rt>あが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115670-115673">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115673-115688"><rb>風</rb><rt>かぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115688-115709">である、といふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115709-115727"><rb>意味</rb><rt>いみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115727-115738">です。</seg></p>
