      <div type="layout" source="#source-173561-173820" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173596-173623"><rb>曳馬野</rb><rt>ひくまの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173623-173626">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173626-173638"><rb>木</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173638-173641">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173641-173653"><rb>芽</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173653-173659">はり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173659-173674"><rb>原</rb><rt>はら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173674-173677">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173677-173689"><rb>入</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173689-173692">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173692-173707"><rb>亂</rb><rt>みだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173707-173713">れ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173713-173734"><rb>春日</rb><rt>はるひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173734-173749">くらすは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173749-173776"><rb>昔人</rb><rt>むかしびと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173776-173784">かも</seg></p>
