        <p><seg source="#source-191033-191057">うちわたす　をち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191057-191081"><rb>方人</rb><rt>かたびと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191081-191087">の、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191087-191102"><rb>道</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191102-191111">おそく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191111-191123"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191123-191126">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191126-191138"><rb>果</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191138-191153">つまじき　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191153-191165"><rb>野</rb><rt>の</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191165-191168">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191168-191189"><rb>景色</rb><rt>けしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191189-191197">かな</seg></p>
